    "['multicast ipv6 routing-enable', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols pim rp static address 2001:db8:6::3', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set protocols pim rp static address 2001:db8:6::3', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset protocols pim rp static address 2001:db8:6::3\\n##\\n\\nNote: While the `multicast ipv6 routing-enable` command in Huawei enables IPv6 multicast routing globally, Juniper has a different approach. In Juniper, IPv6 multicast routing is implicitly enabled when you configure PIM or MLD on interfaces. However, if you specifically need to enable IPv6 multicast routing globally in Juniper (though typically not required), you would use:\\n\\n##\\nset routing-options multicast interface all\\n##\\n\\nBut the closest functional equivalent to the Huawei command's purpose (enabling multicast routing to support the PIM configuration that follows) would be the PIM static RP configuration shown above, since that's the operational multicast configuration that follows in the Huawei config.\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols pim rp static address 2001:db8:6::3'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set routing-options multicast interface all', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'set routing-options multicast interface all', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset protocols pim rp static address 2001:db8:6::3\\n##\\n\\nNote: While the `multicast ipv6 routing-enable` command in Huawei enables IPv6 multicast routing globally, Juniper has a different approach. In Juniper, IPv6 multicast routing is implicitly enabled when you configure PIM or MLD on interfaces. However, if you specifically need to enable IPv6 multicast routing globally in Juniper (though typically not required), you would use:\\n\\n##\\nset routing-options multicast interface all\\n##\\n\\nBut the closest functional equivalent to the Huawei command's purpose (enabling multicast routing to support the PIM configuration that follows) would be the PIM static RP configuration shown above, since that's the operational multicast configuration that follows in the Huawei config.\", 'trans_template': 'set routing-options multicast interface all'}]]": 1,
